12 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/P 11 0 R/T(This document pertains to my being informed about and giving my commitment to participate in the SHG Airshow 2026 / Sivrihisar Airshows. )/E(This document pertains to my being informed about and giving my commitment to participate in the SHG Airshow 2026 / Sivrihisar Airshows. )/Pg 8 0 R/K[0 1]>>
endobj

13 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 36 0 R/E(I have applied to serve as a "Volunteer Staff" at the SHG Airshow 2026 / Sivrihisar Airshows, which will take place at the S.H.M. "Sivrihisar Aviation Center" Necati Artan Facilities. As a result of this application, the S.H.M. Organizing Committee has accepted me as a "Volunteer Staff".)/Pg 8 0 R/K[2]>>
endobj

14 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 37 0 R/E(I acknowledge that I served as a "Volunteer Staff" at the SHG Airshow 2026 / Sivrihisar Airshow without receiving any payment and that I have not received any compensation whatsoever.)/Pg 8 0 R/K[3]>>
endobj

15 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 38 0 R/E(I hereby declare that I assume all legal responsibility for my use of the venue and air facilities provided by S.H.M. \215Sivrihisar Aviation Center\216 at the Necati Artan Facilities for the SHG Airshow 2026 / Sivrihisar Airshows, and that S.H.M. and other companies participating in the event have no legal responsibility towards me, and that I waive all my legal and compensation/damage rights in the event of any such liability.)/Pg 8 0 R/K[4 5]>>
endobj

16 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 39 0 R/E("As a 'Volunteer Staff' at the SHG Airshow 2026 / Sivrihisar Airshows, I will act in accordance with the requirements of 'aviation discipline,' comply with national and international regulations, and adhere to all 'bulletins and instructions' issued and/or to be issued by the SHG Organizing Committee.")/Pg 8 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

17 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 40 0 R/E(I will not interfere in any task that is outside my duties and has not been assigned to me; and if I detect any situation in this regard, I will immediately report it to my volunteer supervisor.)/Pg 8 0 R/K[7]>>
endobj

18 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 41 0 R/E(I will absolutely not get near jet planes,)/Pg 8 0 R/K[8]>>
endobj

19 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 42 0 R/E(I will comply with the hygiene rules set by the organization and S.H.M., )/Pg 8 0 R/K[9]>>
endobj

20 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 43 0 R/E(I understand that the Organization and S.H.M. have taken all necessary preventive safety measures against potential risks and hazards that may arise during the performance of my duties; and that I am responsible for taking the necessary precautions against these potential risks and hazards. )/Pg 8 0 R/K[10 11]>>
endobj

21 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 44 0 R/E(I fully understand and fulfill my duties both mentally and physically, and I accept full legal and criminal responsibility for any damage I cause to the facilities or third parties, and I will compensate for any and all damages that may arise. )/Pg 8 0 R/K[12 13]>>
endobj

22 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 45 0 R/E(I consent to the use of my image\(s\) by other individuals and legal entities operating within S.H.M. and during the organization of this event.)/Pg 8 0 R/K[14]>>
endobj

23 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 46 0 R/E(\215During my duties as a \217Volunteer Personnel,\220 I am aware of the possibility of injury and/or loss of life to myself and/or those around me in the event of errors in aviation operations and/or due to my own mistakes; I understand that in the event of any ground or air accident that may occur at S.H.M., regardless of the cause, the S.H.M. Organizing Committee, S.H.M., the Sivrihisar Aviation Club Association and its Economic Enterprise, and other organizations and/or companies providing air and ground services during the organization shall not be held liable, and all \217legal and criminal responsibility\220 shall belong to me.\216 )/Pg 8 0 R/K[15 16]>>
endobj

24 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 47 0 R/E(I have received and will strictly adhere to the briefings given regarding my duties on the organization and rehearsal dates of September 17, 18, 19, and 20, 2026. )/Pg 8 0 R/K[17 18]>>
endobj

